        "Description": "The bank has a problem, 47. Three people have been quietly selling information about high-value clients. Names, accounts, travel schedules — everything has a price. Our client doesn&apos;t want the operation exposed. No police, no investigation, no spectacular accident.\r\rMake their deaths look like three unrelated tragedies. The bank should open tomorrow as if nothing happened.",
